const STORIES=[{"lang":"English","title":"The Seed Project","text":"Mia went to the school garden. There, Mia found three sunflower seeds. Mia decided to measure their growth. After a little careful work, Mia had a chart. At the end, Mia learned a small science project.","qs":[["Where did Mia go?",["School Garden","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Mia find?",["Three sunflower seeds","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Mia learn?",["A small science project","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Saadprojek","text":"Mia het na die skooltuin gegaan. Daar het Mia drie sonneblomsaadjies gevind. Mia besluit om te hul groei meet. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Mia ’n grafiek gehad. Aan die einde het Mia geleer ’n klein wetenskapprojek.","qs":[["Waarheen het Mia gegaan?",["Skooltuin","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Mia gevind?",["Drie sonneblomsaadjies","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Mia geleer?",["’n klein wetenskapprojek","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Lost Bookmark","text":"Liam went to the library. There, Liam found a blue bookmark. Liam decided to ask the librarian. After a little careful work, Liam had a reading shelf. At the end, Liam learned a new book to explore.","qs":[["Where did Liam go?",["Library","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Liam find?",["A blue bookmark","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Liam learn?",["A new book to explore","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Verlore Boekmerk","text":"Liam het na die biblioteek gegaan. Daar het Liam ’n blou boekmerk gevind. Liam besluit om te die bibliotekaris vra. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Liam ’n boekrak gehad. Aan die einde het Liam geleer ’n nuwe boek om te ontdek.","qs":[["Waarheen het Liam gegaan?",["Biblioteek","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Liam gevind?",["’n blou boekmerk","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Liam geleer?",["’n nuwe boek om te ontdek","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Rainy Race","text":"Ava went to the park. There, Ava found a paper boat. Ava decided to watch which boat travels farthest. After a little careful work, Ava had a puddle. At the end, Ava learned a lesson about water.","qs":[["Where did Ava go?",["Park","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Ava find?",["A paper boat","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Ava learn?",["A lesson about water","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Reënren","text":"Ava het na die park gegaan. Daar het Ava ’n papierbootjie gevind. Ava besluit om te kyk watter bootjie die verste vaar. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Ava ’n plas water gehad. Aan die einde het Ava geleer ’n les oor water.","qs":[["Waarheen het Ava gegaan?",["Park","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Ava gevind?",["’n papierbootjie","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Ava geleer?",["’n les oor water","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Solar Oven","text":"Noah went to the back garden. There, Noah found a cardboard box. Noah decided to test how sunlight warms it. After a little careful work, Noah had a simple oven. At the end, Noah learned a warm snack.","qs":[["Where did Noah go?",["Back Garden","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Noah find?",["A cardboard box","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Noah learn?",["A warm snack","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Sonoond","text":"Noah het na die agtertuin gegaan. Daar het Noah ’n kartondoos gevind. Noah besluit om te toets hoe sonlig dit warm maak. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Noah ’n eenvoudige oond gehad. Aan die einde het Noah geleer ’n warm happie.","qs":[["Waarheen het Noah gegaan?",["Agtertuin","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Noah gevind?",["’n kartondoos","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Noah geleer?",["’n warm happie","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Kindness Jar","text":"Zoe went to the classroom. There, Zoe found a glass jar. Zoe decided to write kind actions. After a little careful work, Zoe had a jar full of notes. At the end, Zoe learned kindness can grow.","qs":[["Where did Zoe go?",["Classroom","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Zoe find?",["A glass jar","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Zoe learn?",["Kindness can grow","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Goedheidsfles","text":"Zoe het na die klaskamer gegaan. Daar het Zoe ’n glasfles gevind. Zoe besluit om te goeie dade neerskryf. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Zoe ’n fles vol briefies gehad. Aan die einde het Zoe geleer dat goedheid kan groei.","qs":[["Waarheen het Zoe gegaan?",["Klaskamer","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Zoe gevind?",["’n glasfles","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Zoe geleer?",["Dat goedheid kan groei","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Map Mystery","text":"Ethan went to the community centre. There, Ethan found a hand-drawn map. Ethan decided to follow three clues. After a little careful work, Ethan had a reading corner. At the end, Ethan learned a message about teamwork.","qs":[["Where did Ethan go?",["Community Centre","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Ethan find?",["A hand-drawn map","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Ethan learn?",["A message about teamwork","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Kaartgeheim","text":"Ethan het na die gemeenskapsentrum gegaan. Daar het Ethan ’n handgetekende kaart gevind. Ethan besluit om te drie leidrade volg. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Ethan ’n leeshoekie gehad. Aan die einde het Ethan geleer ’n boodskap oor spanwerk.","qs":[["Waarheen het Ethan gegaan?",["Gemeenskapsentrum","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Ethan gevind?",["’n handgetekende kaart","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Ethan geleer?",["’n boodskap oor spanwerk","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Bird Watch","text":"Ella went to the school yard. There, Ella found a notebook. Ella decided to record birds without disturbing them. After a little careful work, Ella had a quiet observation spot. At the end, Ella learned new facts about local birds.","qs":[["Where did Ella go?",["School Yard","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Ella find?",["A notebook","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Ella learn?",["New facts about local birds","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Voëlkyk","text":"Ella het na die skoolterrein gegaan. Daar het Ella ’n notaboek gevind. Ella besluit om te voëls waarneem sonder om hulle te pla. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Ella ’n stil kykplek gehad. Aan die einde het Ella geleer nuwe feite oor plaaslike voëls.","qs":[["Waarheen het Ella gegaan?",["Skoolterrein","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Ella gevind?",["’n notaboek","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Ella geleer?",["Nuwe feite oor plaaslike voëls","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Number Shop","text":"Jayden went to the pretend shop. There, Jayden found ten paper coins. Jayden decided to calculate totals and change. After a little careful work, Jayden had a maths game. At the end, Jayden learned a stronger maths skill.","qs":[["Where did Jayden go?",["Pretend Shop","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Jayden find?",["Ten paper coins","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Jayden learn?",["A stronger maths skill","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Getalwinkel","text":"Jayden het na die voorraadwinkel gegaan. Daar het Jayden tien papiermunte gevind. Jayden besluit om te totale en kleingeld bereken. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Jayden ’n wiskundespeletjie gehad. Aan die einde het Jayden geleer ’n sterker wiskundevaardigheid.","qs":[["Waarheen het Jayden gegaan?",["Voorraadwinkel","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Jayden gevind?",["Tien papiermunte","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Jayden geleer?",["’n sterker wiskundevaardigheid","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Recycling Team","text":"Amara went to the school courtyard. There, Amara found three labelled bins. Amara decided to sort clean items. After a little careful work, Amara had a recycling station. At the end, Amara learned a cleaner school.","qs":[["Where did Amara go?",["School Courtyard","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Amara find?",["Three labelled bins","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Amara learn?",["A cleaner school","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Herwinningspan","text":"Amara het na die skoolplaas gegaan. Daar het Amara drie gemerkte dromme gevind. Amara besluit om te skoon items sorteer. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Amara ’n herwinningstasie gehad. Aan die einde het Amara geleer ’n skoner skool.","qs":[["Waarheen het Amara gegaan?",["Skoolplaas","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Amara gevind?",["Drie gemerkte dromme","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Amara geleer?",["’n skoner skool","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Moon Journal","text":"Kai went to the bedroom window. There, Kai found a moon journal. Kai decided to draw the moon each evening. After a little careful work, Kai had a series of sketches. At the end, Kai learned patterns in the night sky.","qs":[["Where did Kai go?",["Bedroom Window","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Kai find?",["A moon journal","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Kai learn?",["Patterns in the night sky","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Maanjoernaal","text":"Kai het na die slaapkamervenster gegaan. Daar het Kai ’n maanjoernaal gevind. Kai besluit om te elke aand die maan teken. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Kai ’n reeks sketse gehad. Aan die einde het Kai geleer patrone in die naghemel.","qs":[["Waarheen het Kai gegaan?",["Slaapkamervenster","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Kai gevind?",["’n maanjoernaal","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Kai geleer?",["Patrone in die naghemel","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Bridge Builders","text":"Sofia went to the classroom. There, Sofia found paper and craft sticks. Sofia decided to test different designs. After a little careful work, Sofia had a strong paper bridge. At the end, Sofia learned mistakes can improve ideas.","qs":[["Where did Sofia go?",["Classroom","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Sofia find?",["Paper and craft sticks","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Sofia learn?",["Mistakes can improve ideas","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Brugbouers","text":"Sofia het na die klaskamer gegaan. Daar het Sofia papier en handwerkstokkies gevind. Sofia besluit om te verskillende ontwerpe toets. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Sofia ’n sterk papierbrug gehad. Aan die einde het Sofia geleer dat foute idees kan verbeter.","qs":[["Waarheen het Sofia gegaan?",["Klaskamer","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Sofia gevind?",["Papier en handwerkstokkies","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Sofia geleer?",["Dat foute idees kan verbeter","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Story Picnic","text":"Ben went to the park. There, Ben found two storybooks. Ben decided to take turns reading aloud. After a little careful work, Ben had a shady tree. At the end, Ben learned a favourite story.","qs":[["Where did Ben go?",["Park","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Ben find?",["Two storybooks","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Ben learn?",["A favourite story","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Storiepiekniek","text":"Ben het na die park gegaan. Daar het Ben twee storieboeke gevind. Ben besluit om te om die beurt hardop lees. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Ben ’n skaduryke boom gehad. Aan die einde het Ben geleer ’n gunstelingstorie.","qs":[["Waarheen het Ben gegaan?",["Park","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Ben gevind?",["Twee storieboeke","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Ben geleer?",["’n gunstelingstorie","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Weather Watchers","text":"Lara went to the school veranda. There, Lara found a thermometer. Lara decided to record temperature and clouds. After a little careful work, Lara had a weather chart. At the end, Lara learned how weather changes.","qs":[["Where did Lara go?",["School Veranda","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Lara find?",["A thermometer","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Lara learn?",["How weather changes","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Weerkykers","text":"Lara het na die skoolstoep gegaan. Daar het Lara ’n termometer gevind. Lara besluit om te temperatuur en wolke aanteken. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Lara ’n weergrafiek gehad. Aan die einde het Lara geleer hoe weer verander.","qs":[["Waarheen het Lara gegaan?",["Skoolstoep","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Lara gevind?",["’n termometer","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Lara geleer?",["Hoe weer verander","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Secret Ingredient","text":"Daniel went to the kitchen. There, Daniel found a recipe card. Daniel decided to measure 