herstelwerk sorg nodig het","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Ocean Poster","text":"Sam went to the classroom. There, Sam found blue paper and drawings. Sam decided to organise facts about oceans. After a little careful work, Sam had a colourful poster. At the end, Sam learned new ocean facts.","qs":[["Where did Sam go?",["Classroom","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Sam find?",["Blue paper and drawings","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Sam learn?",["New ocean facts","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Oseaanplakkaat","text":"Sam het na die klaskamer gegaan. Daar het Sam blou papier en tekeninge gevind. Sam besluit om te feite oor oseane rangskik. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Sam ’n kleurvolle plakkaat gehad. Aan die einde het Sam geleer nuwe oseaanfeite.","qs":[["Waarheen het Sam gegaan?",["Klaskamer","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Sam gevind?",["Blou papier en tekeninge","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Sam geleer?",["Nuwe oseaanfeite","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Puzzle Box","text":"Leah went to the study desk. There, Leah found a wooden puzzle box. Leah decided to solve number clues. After a little careful work, Leah had a hidden note. At the end, Leah learned patience helps solve problems.","qs":[["Where did Leah go?",["Study Desk","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Leah find?",["A wooden puzzle box","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Leah learn?",["Patience helps solve problems","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Legkaartkissie","text":"Leah het na die studietafel gegaan. Daar het Leah ’n houtlegkaartkissie gevind. Leah besluit om te getalleleidrade oplos. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Leah ’n versteekte nota gehad. Aan die einde het Leah geleer dat geduld help om probleme op te los.","qs":[["Waarheen het Leah gegaan?",["Studietafel","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Leah gevind?",["’n houtlegkaartkissie","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Leah geleer?",["Dat geduld help om probleme op te los","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Garden Visitor","text":"Theo went to the vegetable garden. There, Theo found a tiny green frog. Theo decided to watch it quietly. After a little careful work, Theo had a safe place under a leaf. At the end, Theo learned respect for living things.","qs":[["Where did Theo go?",["Vegetable Garden","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Theo find?",["A tiny green frog","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Theo learn?",["Respect for living things","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Tuinbesoeker","text":"Theo het na die groentetuin gegaan. Daar het Theo ’n klein groen padda gevind. Theo besluit om te dit rustig dophou. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Theo ’n veilige plek onder ’n blaar gehad. Aan die einde het Theo geleer respek vir lewende dinge.","qs":[["Waarheen het Theo gegaan?",["Groentetuin","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Theo gevind?",["’n klein groen padda","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Theo geleer?",["Respek vir lewende dinge","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Reading Challenge","text":"Nia went to the home reading corner. There, Nia found a reading tracker. Nia decided to read for fifteen minutes. After a little careful work, Nia had a completed tracker. At the end, Nia learned reading every day builds confidence.","qs":[["Where did Nia go?",["Home Reading Corner","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Nia find?",["A reading tracker","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Nia learn?",["Reading every day builds confidence","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Leesuitdaging","text":"Nia het na die