et Adam ’n kort ritme gehad. Aan die einde het Adam geleer dat patrone in musiek voorkom.","qs":[["Waarheen het Adam gegaan?",["Musiekkamer","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Adam gevind?",["’n klein drom","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Adam geleer?",["Dat patrone in musiek voorkom","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Safe Crossing","text":"Emma went to the street corner. There, Emma found a bright safety card. Emma decided to practise the safe crossing steps. After a little careful work, Emma had a safe crossing plan. At the end, Emma learned look, listen and think before crossing.","qs":[["Where did Emma go?",["Street Corner","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Emma find?",["A bright safety card","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Emma learn?",["Look, listen and think before crossing","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Veilige Oorgang","text":"Emma het na die straathoek gegaan. Daar het Emma ’n helder veiligheidskaart gevind. Emma besluit om te veilige oorgangstappe oefen. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Emma ’n veilige plan gehad. Aan die einde het Emma geleer om te kyk, luister en dink voor jy oorsteek.","qs":[["Waarheen het Emma gegaan?",["Straathoek","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Emma gevind?",["’n helder veiligheidskaart","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Emma geleer?",["Om te kyk, luister en dink voor jy oorsteek","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Budget Picnic","text":"Finn went to the kitchen table. There, Finn found a small budget. Finn decided to choose snacks without spending too much. After a little careful work, Finn had a picnic list. At the end, Finn learned planning helps manage money.","qs":[["Where did Finn go?",["Kitchen Table","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Finn find?",["A small budget","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Finn learn?",["Planning helps manage money","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Piekniekbegroting","text":"Finn het na die kombuistafel gegaan. Daar het Finn ’n klein begroting gevind. Finn besluit om te happies kies sonder om te veel te spandeer. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Finn ’n pieknieklys gehad. Aan die einde het Finn geleer dat beplanning geld help bestuur.","qs":[["Waarheen het Finn gegaan?",["Kombuistafel","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Finn gevind?",["’n klein begroting","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Finn geleer?",["Dat beplanning geld help bestuur","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Mountain Model","text":"Chloe went to the science table. There, Chloe found clay and cardboard. Chloe decided to build a mountain model. After a little careful work, Chloe had a model with labelled parts. At the end, Chloe learned landforms have different shapes.","qs":[["Where did Chloe go?",["Science Table","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Chloe find?",["Clay and cardboard","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Chloe learn?",["Landforms have different shapes","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Bergmodel","text":"Chloe het na die wetenskaptafel gegaan. Daar het Chloe klei en karton gevind. Chloe besluit om te ’n bergmodel bou. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Chloe ’n model met gemerkte dele gehad. Aan die einde het Chloe geleer dat landvorme verskillende vorms het.","qs":[["Waarheen het Chloe gegaan?",["Wetenskaptafel","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Chloe gevind?",["Klei en karton","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Chloe geleer?",["Dat landvorme verskillende vorms het","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Library Helper","text":"Leo went to the library. There, Leo found a trolley of books. Leo decided to sort books by topic. After a little careful work, Leo had an organised shelf. At the end, Leo learned labels make finding books easier.","qs":[["Where did Leo go?",["Library","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Leo find?",["A trolley of books","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Leo learn?",["Labels make finding books easier","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Biblioteekhelper","text":"Leo het na die biblioteek gegaan. Daar het Leo ’n trollie boeke gevind. Leo besluit om te boeke volgens onderwerp sorteer. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Leo ’n netjiese rak gehad. Aan die einde het Leo geleer dat etikette boeke makliker vindbaar maak.","qs":[["Waarheen het Leo gegaan?",["Biblioteek","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Leo gevind?",["’n trollie boeke","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Leo geleer?",["Dat etikette boeke makliker vindbaar maak","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Clean Water Test","text":"Aria went to the science club. There, Aria found two clear cups. Aria decided to compare clean and muddy water. After a little careful work, Aria had a simple observation sheet. At the end, Aria learned water quality matters.","qs":[["Where did Aria go?",["Science Club","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Aria find?",["Two clear cups","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Aria learn?",["Water quality matters","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Skoonwatertoets","text":"Aria het na die wetenskapklub gegaan. Daar het Aria twee helder koppies gevind. Aria besluit om te skoon en modderige water vergelyk. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Aria ’n eenvoudige waarnemingsblad gehad. Aan die einde het Aria geleer dat watergehalte belangrik is.","qs":[["Waarheen het Aria gegaan?",["Wetenskapklub","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Aria gevind?",["Twee helder koppies","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Aria geleer?",["Dat watergehalte belangrik is","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Friendship Flag","text":"Max went to the classroom. There, Max found coloured paper. Max decided to design a flag together. After a little careful work, Max had a class flag. At the end, Max learned listening helps groups work well.","qs":[["Where did Max go?",["Classroom","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Max find?",["Coloured paper","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Max learn?",["Listening helps groups work well","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Vriendskapsvlag","text":"Max het na die klaskamer gegaan. Daar het Max gekleurde papier gevind. Max besluit om te saam ’n vlag ontwerp. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Max ’n klasvlag gehad. Aan die einde het Max geleer dat luister groepe help saamwerk.","qs":[["Waarheen het Max gegaan?",["Klaskamer","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Max gevind?",["Gekleurde papier","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Max geleer?",["Dat luister groepe help saamwerk","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Mini Farm","text":"Poppy went to the back yard. There, Poppy found small pots and soil. Poppy decided to plant herbs and label them. After a little careful work, Poppy had a mini herb garden. At the end, Poppy learned plants can be grown in small spaces.","qs":[["Where did Poppy go?",["Back Yard","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Poppy find?",["Small pots and soil","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Poppy learn?",["Plants can be grown in small spaces","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Mini Plaas","text":"Poppy het na die agterplaas gegaan. Daar het Poppy klein potte en grond gevind. Poppy besluit om te kruie plant en etiketteer. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Poppy ’n mini-kruietuin gehad. Aan die einde het Poppy geleer dat plante in klein ruimtes kan groei.","qs":[["Waarheen het Poppy gegaan?",["Agterplaas","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Poppy gevind?",["Klein potte en grond","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Poppy geleer?",["Dat plante in klein ruimtes kan groei","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Traffic Light Game","text":"Ryan went to the driveway. There, Ryan found red, yellow and green cards. Ryan decided to practise safe road decisions. After a little careful work, Ryan had a safety game. At the end, Ryan learned colours can signal actions.","qs":[["Where did Ryan go?",["Driveway","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Ryan find?",["Red, yellow and green cards","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Ryan learn?",["Colours can signal actions","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Verkeersligspeletjie","text":"Ryan het na die oprit gegaan. Daar het Ryan rooi, geel en groen kaarte gevind. Ryan besluit om te veilige padbesluite oefen. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Ryan ’n veiligheidsspeletjie gehad. Aan die einde het Ryan geleer dat kleure aksies kan aandui.","qs":[["Waarheen het Ryan gegaan?",["Oprit","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Ryan gevind?",["Rooi, geel en groen kaarte","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Ryan geleer?",["Dat kleure aksies kan aandui","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Star Collector","text":"Mason went to the bedroom. There, Mason found a star chart. Mason decided to earn stars for reading practice. After a little careful work, Mason had a full chart. At the end, Mason learned small goals can build a habit.","qs":[["Where did Mason go?",["Bedroom","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Mason find?",["A star chart","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Mason learn?",["Small goals can build a habit","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Sterresamelaar","text":"Mason het na die slaapkamer gegaan. Daar het Mason ’n sterkaart gevind. Mason besluit om te sterre verdien vir leesoefening. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Mason ’n vol kaart gehad. Aan die einde het Mason geleer dat klein doelwitte ’n gewoonte kan bou.","qs":[["Waarheen het Mason gegaan?",["Slaapkamer","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Mason gevind?",["’n sterkaart","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Mason geleer?",["Dat klein doelwitte ’n gewoonte kan bou","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Fraction Pizza","text":"Hannah went to the classroom. There, Hannah found a paper pizza. Hannah decided to divide it into equal parts. After a little careful work, Hannah had a fraction pizza. At the end, Hannah learned fractions describe equal parts.","qs":[["Where did Hannah go?",["Classroom","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Hannah find?",["A paper pizza","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Hannah learn?",["Fractions describe equal parts","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Breukpizza","text":"Hannah het na die klaskamer gegaan. Daar het Hannah ’n papierpizza gevind. Hannah besluit om te dit in gelyke dele verdeel. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Hannah ’n breukpizza gehad. Aan die einde het Hannah geleer dat breuke gelyke dele beskryf.","qs":[["Waarheen het Hannah gegaan?",["Klaskamer","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Hannah gevind?",["’n papierpizza","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Hannah geleer?",["Dat breuke gelyke dele beskryf","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Recycling Robot","text":"Aiden went to the school hall. There, Aiden found clean boxes and bottles. Aiden decided to build a robot from reusable items. After a little careful work, Aiden had a recycled robot. At the end, Aiden learned old materials can have new uses.","qs":[["Where did Aiden go?",["School Hall","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Aiden find?",["Clean boxes and bottles","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Aiden learn?",["Old materials can have new uses","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Herwinningsrobot","text":"Aiden het na die skoolsaal gegaan. Daar het Aiden skoon bokse en bottels gevind. Aiden besluit om te ’n robot uit herbruikbare items bou. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Aiden ’n herwinningsrobot gehad. Aan die einde het Aiden geleer dat ou materiale nuwe gebruike kan kry.","qs":[["Waarheen het Aiden gegaan?",["Skoolsaal","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Aiden gevind?",["Skoon bokse en bottels","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Aiden geleer?",["Dat ou materiale nuwe gebruike kan kry","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Quiet Library","text":"Sienna went to the library. There, Sienna found a whisper card. Sienna decided to help visitors keep voices low. After a little careful work, Sienna had a calm reading space. At the end, Sienna learned quiet spaces help concentration.","qs":[["Where did Sienna go?",["Library","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Sienna find?",["A whisper card","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Sienna learn?",["Quiet spaces help concentration","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Stil Biblioteek","text":"Sienna het na die biblioteek gegaan. Daar het Sienna ’n fluisterkaart gevind. Sienna besluit om te besoekers help om sag te praat. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Sienna ’n rustige leesplek gehad. Aan die einde het Sienna geleer dat stil ruimtes konsentrasie help.","qs":[["Waarheen het Sienna gegaan?",["Biblioteek","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Sienna gevind?",["’n fluisterkaart","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Sienna geleer?",["Dat stil ruimtes konsentrasie help","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Nature Walk","text":"Cole went to the nature trail. There, Cole found a checklist. Cole decided to identify safe things to observe. After a little careful work, Cole had a completed checklist. At the end, Cole learned careful observation teaches us.","qs":[["Where did Cole go?",["Nature Trail","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Cole find?",["A checklist","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Cole learn?",["Careful observation teaches us","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Natuurstap","text":"Cole het na die natuurroete gegaan. Daar het Cole ’n kontrolelys gevind. Cole besluit om te veilige dinge identifiseer om waar te neem. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Cole ’n voltooide lys gehad. Aan die einde het Cole geleer dat versigtige waarneming ons leer.","qs":[["Waarheen het Cole gegaan?",["Natuurroete","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Cole gevind?",["’n kontrolelys","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Cole geleer?",["Dat versigtige waarneming ons leer","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Marble Ramp","text":"Layla went to the garage. There, Layla found three toy cars. Layla decided to test ramps of different heights. After a little careful work, Layla had a results table. At the end, Layla learned fair tests change one thing at a time.","qs":[["Where did Layla go?",["Garage","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Layla find?",["Three toy cars","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Layla learn?",["Fair tests change one thing at a time","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Albasterhelling","text":"Layla het na die motorhuis gegaan. Daar het Layla drie speelgoedmotors gevind. Layla besluit om te hellings van verskillende hoogtes toets. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Layla ’n resultate-tabel gehad. Aan die einde het Layla geleer dat ’n billike toets een ding op ’n slag verander.","qs":[["Waarheen het Layla gegaan?",["Motorhuis","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Layla gevind?",["Drie speelgoedmotors","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Layla geleer?",["Dat ’n billike toets een ding op ’n slag verander","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Word Garden","text":"Jaden went to the classroom wall. There, Jaden found paper flowers. Jaden decided to write new vocabulary on each flower. After a little careful work, Jaden had a word garden. At the end, Jaden learned new words grow through practice.","qs":[["Where did Jaden go?",["Classroom Wall","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Jaden find?",["Paper flowers","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Jaden learn?",["New words grow through practice","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Woordtuin","text":"Jaden het na die klaskamermuur gegaan. Daar het Jaden papierblomme gevind. Jaden besluit om te nuwe woordeskat op elke blom skryf. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Jaden ’n woordtuin gehad. Aan die einde het Jaden geleer dat nuwe woorde deur oefening groei.","qs":[["Waarheen het Jaden gegaan?",["Klaskamermuur","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Jaden gevind?",["Papierblomme","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Jaden geleer?",["Dat nuwe woorde deur oefening groei","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Compass Walk","text":"Mia went to the school field. There, Mia found a simple compass. Mia decided to follow north, south, east and west clues. After a little careful work, Mia had a completed route. At the end, Mia learned directions help us navigate.","qs":[["Where did Mia go?",["School Field","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Mia find?",["A simple compass","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Mia learn?",["Directions help us navigate","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Kompasstap","text":"Mia het na die skoolveld gegaan. Daar het Mia ’n eenvoudige kompas gevind. Mia besluit om te noord, suid, oos en wes leidrade volg. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Mia ’n voltooide roete gehad. Aan die einde het Mia geleer dat rigtings ons help navigeer.","qs":[["Waarheen het Mia gegaan?",["Skoolveld","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Mia gevind?",["’n eenvoudige kompas","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Mia geleer?",["Dat rigtings ons help navigeer","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Healthy Lunch","text":"Eli went to the kitchen. There, Eli found fruit, bread and yoghurt. Eli decided to plan a balanced lunch. After a little careful work, Eli had a colourful lunchbox. At the end, Eli learned different foods provide different nutrients.","qs":[["Where did Eli go?",["Kitchen","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Eli find?",["Fruit, bread and yoghurt","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Eli learn?",["Different foods provide different nutrients","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Gesonde Middagete","text":"Eli het na die kombuis gegaan. Daar het Eli vrugte, brood en jogurt gevind. Eli besluit om te ’n gebalanseerde middagete beplan. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Eli ’n kleurvolle kosblik gehad. Aan die einde het Eli geleer dat verskillende kosse verskillende voedingstowwe gee.","qs":[["Waarheen het Eli gegaan?",["Kombuis","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Eli gevind?",["Vrugte, brood en jogurt","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Eli geleer?",["Dat verskillende kosse verskillende voedingstowwe gee","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Tiny Theatre","text":"Ari went to the classroom. There, Ari found paper puppets. Ari decided to write and perform a short scene. After a little careful work, Ari had a puppet show. At the end, Ari learned reading aloud can build confidence.","qs":[["Where did Ari go?",["Classroom","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Ari find?",["Paper puppets","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Ari learn?",["Reading aloud can build confidence","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Klein Teater","text":"Ari het na die klaskamer gegaan. Daar het Ari papierpoppe gevind. Ari besluit om te ’n kort toneel skryf en opvoer. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Ari ’n poppeteater gehad. Aan die einde het Ari geleer dat hardop lees selfvertroue kan bou.","qs":[["Waarheen het Ari gegaan?",["Klaskamer","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Ari gevind?",["Papierpoppe","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Ari geleer?",["Dat hardop lees selfvertroue kan bou","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Rain Gauge","text":"Zara went to the garden. There, Zara found a clear measuring cup. Zara decided to measure rainfall after storms. After a little careful work, Zara had a rain record. At the end, Zara learned weather can be measured.","qs":[["Where did Zara go?",["Garden","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Zara find?",["A clear measuring cup","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Zara learn?",["Weather can be measured","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Reënmeter","text":"Zara het na die tuin gegaan. Daar het Zara ’n helder maatbeker gevind. Zara besluit om te reënval ná storms meet. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Zara ’n reënrekord gehad. Aan die einde het Zara geleer dat weer gemeet kan word.","qs":[["Waarheen het Zara gegaan?",["Tuin","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Zara gevind?",["’n helder maatbeker","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Zara geleer?",["Dat weer gemeet kan word","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Code Wheel","text":"Theo went to the desk. There, Theo found a paper code wheel. Theo decided to decode a friendly message. After a little careful work, Theo had a secret note. At the end, Theo learned patterns can carry information.","qs":[["Where did Theo go?",["Desk","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Theo find?",["A paper code wheel","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Theo learn?",["Patterns can carry information","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Kodewiel","text":"Theo het na die lessenaar gegaan. Daar het Theo ’n papierkodewiel gevind. Theo besluit om te ’n vriendelike boodskap ontsyfer. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Theo ’n geheime nota gehad. Aan die einde het Theo geleer dat patrone inligting kan dra.","qs":[["Waarheen het Theo gegaan?",["Lessenaar","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Theo gevind?",["’n papierkodewiel","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Theo geleer?",["Dat patrone inligting kan dra","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Team Relay","text":"Nolan went to the sports field. There, Nolan found four cones. Nolan decided to plan a fair relay. After a little careful work, Nolan had a smooth relay. At the end, Nolan learned teamwork and practice matter.","qs":[["Where did Nolan go?",["Sports Field","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Nolan find?",["Four cones","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Nolan learn?",["Teamwork and practice matter","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Span-aflos","text":"Nolan het na die sportveld gegaan. Daar het Nolan vier keëls gevind. Nolan besluit om te ’n billike aflos beplan. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Nolan ’n gladde aflos gehad. Aan die einde het Nolan geleer dat spanwerk en oefening belangrik is.","qs":[["Waarheen het Nolan gegaan?",["Sportveld","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Nolan gevind?",["Vier keëls","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Nolan geleer?",["Dat spanwerk en oefening belangrik is","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Book Review","text":"Lily went to the reading corner. There, Lily found a favourite book. Lily decided to write three reasons she liked it. After a little careful work, Lily had a short review. At the end, Lily learned readers can explain their opinions.","qs":[["Where did Lily go?",["Reading Corner","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Lily find?",["A favourite book","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Lily learn?",["Readers can explain their opinions","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Boekresensie","text":"Lily het na die leeskamer gegaan. Daar het Lily ’n gunstelingboek gevind. Lily besluit om te drie redes skryf waarom sy daarvan hou. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Lily ’n kort resensie gehad. Aan die einde het Lily geleer dat lesers hul menings kan verduidelik.","qs":[["Waarheen het Lily gegaan?",["Leeskamer","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Lily gevind?",["’n gunstelingboek","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Lily geleer?",["Dat lesers hul menings kan verduidelik","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Little Inventor","text":"Owen went to the workshop table. There, Owen found straws and tape. Owen decided to build a tower that stands by itself. After a little careful work, Owen had a tall tower. At the end, Owen learned testing helps improve designs.","qs":[["Where did Owen go?",["Workshop Table","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Owen find?",["Straws and tape","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Owen learn?",["Testing helps improve designs","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Klein Uitvinder","text":"Owen het na die werksbank gegaan. Daar het Owen strooitjies en kleefband gevind. Owen besluit om te ’n toring bou wat self staan. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Owen ’n hoë toring gehad. Aan die einde het Owen geleer dat toetsing ontwerpe verbeter.","qs":[["Waarheen het Owen gegaan?",["Werksbank","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Owen gevind?",["Strooitjies en kleefband","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Owen geleer?",["Dat toetsing ontwerpe verbeter","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]},{"lang":"English","title":"The Night Sky Club","text":"Maya went to the school roof area. There, Maya found a star chart. Maya decided to compare visible stars on two nights. After a little careful work, Maya had a shared observation page. At the end, Maya learned careful notes help scientists.","qs":[["Where did Maya go?",["School Roof Area","A cinema","A stadium"],0],["What did Maya find?",["A star chart","A sandwich","A toy"],0],["What did Maya learn?",["Careful notes help scientists","That practice is useless","That questions are bad"],0]]},{"lang":"Afrikaans","title":"Die Naghemelklub","text":"Maya het na die skool se dakarea gegaan. Daar het Maya ’n sterkaart gevind. Maya besluit om te sigbare sterre op twee aande vergelyk. Ná ’n bietjie versigtige werk het Maya ’n gedeelde waarnemingsblad gehad. Aan die einde het Maya geleer dat noukeurige notas wetenskaplikes help.","qs":[["Waarheen het Maya gegaan?",["Skool se dakarea","’n Bioskoop","’n Stadion"],0],["Wat het Maya gevind?",["’n sterkaart","’n Toebroodjie","’n Speelding"],0],["Wat het Maya geleer?",["Dat noukeurige notas wetenskaplikes help","Dat oefening nutteloos is","Dat vrae sleg is"],0]]}];
const LESSONS={English:[['Nouns','A noun names a person, place, animal or thing.'],['Verbs','A verb tells an action.'],['Adjectives','An adjective describes a noun.'],['Sentence Builder','A complete sentence starts with a capital letter and ends with . ? or !'],['Reading Strategy','Preview the title, predict what may happen, read, then explain the main idea.'],['Spelling Strategy','Say the word, look at the tricky part, cover it, write it, then check.'],['Vocabulary in Context','Use a new word in your own sentence instead of only memorising it.'],['Comprehension','Ask: Who? What? Where? When? Why? How?']],Afrikaans:[['Selfstandige naamwoorde','Dit benoem ’n persoon, plek, dier of ding.'],['Werkwoorde','Dit wys ’n handeling.'],['Byvoeglike naamwoorde','Dit beskryf ’n naamwoord.'],['Sinbou','Begin met ’n hoofletter en gebruik die regte leesteken.'],['Leesstrategie','Kyk na die titel, voorspel, lees en vertel die hoofgedagte in jou eie woorde.'],['Spelstrategie','Sê die woord, kyk na die moeilike deel, bedek dit, skryf dit en kontroleer.'],['Woordeskat in konteks','Gebruik ’n nuwe woord in jou eie sin.'],['Begrip','Vra: Wie? Wat? Waar? Wanneer? Waarom? Hoe?']]};
let S=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('wa_state')||'null')||{stars:0,streak:0,level:1,weak:{},done:0,correct:0,badges:[],words:0,spelling:0,maths:0,stories:0,gameWins:0,review:{}};
let page='home',current=null,speakTimer=null,spellMode='English',speedTimer=null,speedScore=0,speedIndex=0,storyFilter='All',storyIndex=0;
const $=x=>document.getElementById(x);
function save(){localStorage.setItem('wa_state',JSON.stringify(S));stats()}
function stats(){if($('stars'))$('stars').textContent=S.stars;if($('streak'))$('streak').textContent=S.streak;if($('level'))$('level').textContent=S.level}
function reward(n,msg){S.stars+=n;S.correct++;S.done++;S.level=Math.floor(S.stars/100)+1;if(!S.streak)S.streak=1;save();pop(msg,`⭐ +${n} stars!`)}
function pop(t,x){$('mt').textContent=t;$('mx').textContent=x;$('modal').classList.remove('hidden')}
function closePop(){if($('modal'))$('modal').classList.add('hidden')}
function speak(text,lang='English'){
  if(!('speechSynthesis' in window) || !('SpeechSynthesisUtterance' in window)){pop('Read aloud is unavailable','This browser does not provide text-to-speech. Try Chrome on the tablet.');return}
  const start=()=>{
    speechSynthesis.cancel();
    const u=new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(String(text));
    const target=lang==='Afrikaans'?'af-ZA':'en-ZA';
    u.lang=target; u.rate=0.86; u.pitch=1; u.volume=1;
    const voices=speechSynthesis.getVoices();
    const exact=voices.find(v=>(v.lang||'').toLowerCase()===target.toLowerCase());
    const regional=voices.find(v=>(v.lang||'').toLowerCase().startsWith(target.slice(0,2).toLowerCase()));
    const englishFallback=voices.find(v=>(v.lang||'').toLowerCase().startsWith('en'));
    if(exact||regional||englishFallback) u.voice=exact||regional||englishFallback;
    u.onstart=()=>showSpeakStatus('🔊 Reading…');
    u.onend=()=>showSpeakStatus('✓ Finished');
    u.onerror=()=>showSpeakStatus('⚠️ Tap Read aloud again');
    speechSynthesis.speak(u);
    showSpeakStatus('🔊 Starting…');
  };
  // Android browsers can populate voices asynchronously. Give them a moment.
  if(speechSynthesis.getVoices().length===0){
    let done=false;
    const ready=()=>{if(done)return;done=true;speechSynthesis.removeEventListener('voiceschanged',ready);start()};
    speechSynthesis.addEventListener('voiceschanged',ready);
    setTimeout(ready,500);
  }else start();
}
function speakOptions(options,lang='English'){speak(options.map((x,i)=>`Option ${i+1}: ${x}`).join('. '),lang)}
function showSpeakStatus(t){const el=$('speakStatus');if(el){el.textContent=t;clearTimeout(speakTimer);speakTimer=setTimeout(()=>el.textContent='',2200)}}
function stopSpeaking(){if('speechSynthesis' in window)speechSynthesis.cancel();showSpeakStatus('⏹ Stopped')}
function attr(v){return String(v).replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/"/g,'&quot;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;')}
function speakData(el){speak(el.dataset.text||'',el.dataset.lang||'English')}
function speakOptionsData(el){try{speakOptions(JSON.parse(el.dataset.options||'[]'),el.dataset.lang||'English')}catch(e){speak(el.dataset.options||'',el.dataset.lang||'English')}}
window.speakData=speakData;window.speakOptionsData=speakOptionsData;

function go(p){page=p;document.body.classList.toggle('category-open',p!=='home');render();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})}
function goHome(){stopSpeaking();if(speedTimer){clearInterval(speedTimer);speedTimer=null}go('home')}
window.go=go;window.goHome=goHome;window.speak=speak;window.stopSpeaking=stopSpeaking;window.closePop=closePop;window.chooseGameAnswer=chooseGameAnswer;window.checkTypedGame=checkTypedGame;window.addWord=addWord;window.checkSentence=checkSentence;window.checkMath=checkMath;window.checkTime=checkTime;window.checkTypedData=checkTypedData;window.checkTimeData=checkTimeData;window.practiseWeak=practiseWeak;
function back(){goHome()}
function pageTop(title,sub=''){return `<div class="page-top"><button class="round-back" onclick="back()" aria-label="Go back">←</button><div><h2>${title}</h2><p>${sub}</p></div><span id="speakStatus" class="speak-status"></span></div>`}
function home(){return `<section class="hero"><h2>🌟 Welcome, Word Adventurer!</h2><p>Choose a learning world. Every mistake is a chance to learn. 💪</p><div class="grid"><button class="tile" data-page="learn"><span>📚</span><b>Learn & Study</b><small>English + Afrikaans lessons</small></button><button class="tile" data-page="spelling"><span>✏️</span><b>Spelling Lab</b><small>800 spelling words</small></button><button class="tile" data-page="games"><span>🎮</span><b>Game Zone</b><small>8 learning games</small></button><button class="tile" data-page="stories"><span>📖</span><b>Story World</b><small>100 books • 50 English + 50 Afrikaans</small></button><button class="tile" data-page="maths"><span>➗</span><b>Maths Academy</b><small>Grade 3–7 practice</small></button><button class="tile" data-page="time"><span>🕒</span><b>Time Academy</b><small>Clocks, duration & schedules</small></button><button class="tile" data-page="dictionary"><span>📕</span><b>My Dictionary</b><small>Extra practice for tricky words</small></button><button class="tile" data-page="progress"><span>📊</span><b>My Progress</b><small>Stars, badges & goals</small></button></div></section><section class="card"><h2>🏅 Your adventure</h2><p>⭐ ${S.stars} stars • 🏆 Level ${S.level} • ✏️ ${S.spelling} spelling wins • 🎮 ${S.gameWins} game wins</p><p>${S.badges.map(b=>`<span class="badge">${b}</span>`).join('')||'Play and learn to unlock badges! 🌟'}</p></section>`}
function learn(){return `<section class="card fullscreen-card">${pageTop('📚 Learning Library','Short lessons, examples and practice.')}<div class="row"><button class="primary" onclick="learnLang('English')">🇬🇧 English</button><button onclick="learnLang('Afrikaans')">🇿🇦 Afrikaans</button><button onclick="speak('Welcome to the learning library. Let us learn together!','English')">🔊 Read aloud</button></div><div id="lessonArea">${lessonHTML('English')}</div></section><section class="card fullscreen-card"><h2>🌟 Word of the Day</h2>${wordCard(WORDS[Math.floor(Math.random()*WORDS.length)])}</section>`}
function learnLang(l){$('lessonArea').innerHTML=lessonHTML(l);showSpeakStatus('')}
function lessonHTML(l){return `<h3>${l} Mini Lessons</h3>${LESSONS[l].map((x,i)=>`<div class="lesson"><h3>${i+1}. ${x[0]}</h3><p>${x[1]}</p><button onclick="speakData(this)" data-text="${attr(x[1])}" data-lang="${l}">🔊 Read aloud</button><button onclick="reward(3,'Lesson completed! 📚')">I understand ⭐</button></div>`).join('')}<h3>Vocabulary Practice</h3>${WORDS.slice(0,16).map(wordCard).join('')}`}
function wordCard(w){return `<div class="lesson"><b>${w[0]}</b> — <b>${w[1]}</b><p>${w[2]}</p><button onclick="speakData(this)" data-text="${attr(w[0])}" data-lang="English">🔊 English</button><button onclick="speakData(this)" data-text="${attr(w[1])}" data-lang="Afrikaans">🔊 Afrikaans</button><button onclick="reward(2,'Word practised!')">Practised ⭐</button></div>`}
function gradeWords(){const g=Number($('grade').value||3);const n=Math.min(800,Math.max(150,150+(g-3)*160));return SPELL_WORDS.slice(0,n)}
function spelling(){const bank=gradeWords();if(!current)current=bank[Math.floor(Math.random()*bank.length)];if(!spellMode)spellMode='English';return `<section class="card fullscreen-card">${pageTop('✏️ Spelling Lab','800 English spelling words plus Afrikaans vocabulary practice.')}<div class="row"><button class="primary" type="button" onclick="newSpelling('English')">🇬🇧 English</button><button type="button" onclick="newSpelling('Afrikaans')">🇿🇦 Afrikaans</button></div><p><b>${SPELL_WORDS.length}</b> English spelling words are loaded.</p><div class="big">🔊</div><button type="button" class="primary" onclick="hearCurrentSpelling()">🔊 Hear word clearly</button><button type="button" onclick="stopSpeaking()">⏹ Stop</button><span id="speakStatus" class="speak-status"></span><input id="sp" class="input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Type the word you hear"><button type="button" class="green" onclick="checkSpelling()">Check ⭐</button><button type="button" onclick="newSpelling(spellMode)">Next word ➜</button><div class="lesson"><b>Spelling strategy:</b> Say it → look at the tricky part → cover it → write it → check it.</div></section>`}

function newSpelling(mode){spellMode=mode;current=mode==='English'?gradeWords()[Math.floor(Math.random()*gradeWords().length)]:WORDS[Math.floor(Math.random()*WORDS.length)];go('spelling')}
function hearCurrentSpelling(){const word=spellMode==='English'?current:current[spellMode==='Afrikaans'?1:0];speak(word,spellMode)}
function checkSpelling(){const input=$('sp');const a=(input?.value||'').trim().toLowerCase();const answer=spellMode==='English'?String(current).toLowerCase():current[1].toLowerCase();if(a===answer){S.spelling++;if(S.spelling===5&&!S.badges.includes('✏️ Spelling Star'))S.badges.push('✏️ Spelling Star');reward(10,'Spelling superstar! ✨');if(input)input.disabled=true}else{const key=spellMode==='English'?answer:current[0];S.weak[key]=(S.weak[key]||0)+1;save();pop('Almost! 💪',`The word is “${answer}”. It is saved in My Dictionary for extra practice.`)}}

function games(){return `<section class="card fullscreen-card">${pageTop('🎮 Game Zone','Eight playful ways to practise words.')}<div class="grid"><button class="tile" onclick="matchGame()"><span>🧩</span><b>Match Words</b><small>English ↔ Afrikaans</small></button><button class="tile" onclick="missingGame()"><span>🔎</span><b>Missing Letter</b><small>Complete the word</small></button><button class="tile" onclick="unscramble()"><span>🔤</span><b>Unscramble</b><small>Fix the letters</small></button><button class="tile" onclick="sentenceGame()"><span>🧱</span><b>Sentence Builder</b><small>Build a sentence</small></button><button class="tile" onclick="synonymGame()"><span>🔗</span><b>Meaning Match</b><small>Pick a close meaning</small></button><button class="tile" onclick="translationGame()"><span>🌍</span><b>Language Switch</b><small>Translate a word</small></button><button class="tile" onclick="speedChallenge()"><span>⚡</span><b>80 Words / 60 Seconds</b><small>Speed challenge</small></button><button class="tile" onclick="memoryGame()"><span>🧠</span><b>Memory Pairs</b><small>Remember the match</small></button></div></section>`}
function gameShell(title,body){$('app').innerHTML=`<section class="card fullscreen-card">${pageTop(title,'Learn while you play.')} ${body}<button onclick="go('games')">← Back to games</button></section>`}
function winGame(msg,n=7){S.gameWins++;reward(n,msg);if(S.gameWins===5&&!S.badges.includes('🎮 Game Explorer'))S.badges.push('🎮 Game Explorer');}
function chooseGameAnswer(btn){const ok=btn.dataset.correct==='true';const buttons=[...btn.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.game-choice')];if(ok){buttons.forEach(b=>b.disabled=true);btn.classList.add('correct');winGame('Correct! 🎉');$('nextGame')?.classList.remove('hidden')}else{btn.classList.add('wrong');pop('Try again! 💪','Have another look and choose again.')}}
function checkTypedGame(id,answer,nextFn,msg){const input=$(id);const got=(input?.value||'').trim().toLowerCase();if(got===String(answer).toLowerCase()){winGame(msg);if(input)input.disabled=true;$('nextGame')?.classList.remove('hidden')}else pop('Almost! 💪','Check the letters and try again.')}
function checkTypedData(btn,id,nextFn,msg){checkTypedGame(id,btn.dataset.answer,nextFn,msg)}
function matchGame(){const w=WORDS[Math.floor(Math.random()*WORDS.length)];const opts=[w[1],...WORDS.filter(x=>x[1]!==w[1]).sort(()=>Math.random()-.5).slice(0,3).map(x=>x[1])].sort(()=>Math.random()-.5);gameShell('🧩 Match It!',`<div class="big">${w[0]}</div><p>Choose the Afrikaans meaning:</p>${opts.map(x=>`<button type="button" class="choice game-choice" data-correct="${x===w[1]}" onclick="chooseGameAnswer(this)">${x}</button>`).join('')}<div id="nextGame" class="row hidden"><button class="primary" type="button" onclick="matchGame()">Next ➜</button></div>`)}

function missingGame(){const w=SPELL_WORDS[Math.floor(Math.random()*SPELL_WORDS.length)];const p=Math.max(1,Math.floor(w.length/2));gameShell('🔎 Missing Letter',`<div class="big">${w.slice(0,p)}_${w.slice(p+1)}</div><input id="mi" class="input" placeholder="Type the whole word" autocomplete="off"><button type="button" class="green" data-answer="${attr(w)}" onclick="checkTypedData(this,'mi','missingGame','You found it! 🔎')">Check ⭐</button><div id="nextGame" class="row hidden"><button class="primary" type="button" onclick="missingGame()">Next ➜</button></div>`)}

function unscramble(){const w=SPELL_WORDS[Math.floor(Math.random()*SPELL_WORDS.length)];const m=w.split('').sort(()=>Math.random()-.5).join('');gameShell('🔤 Unscramble',`<div class="big">${m}</div><input id="un" class="input" autocomplete="off"><button type="button" class="green" data-answer="${attr(w)}" onclick="checkTypedData(this,'un','unscramble','Fantastic! 🔤')">Check ⭐</button><div id="nextGame" class="row hidden"><button class="primary" type="button" onclick="unscramble()">Next ➜</button></div>`)}

function sentenceGame(){const sets=[['The','small','bird','sings'],['My','friend','likes','books'],['We','can','learn','together'],['The','bright','sun','shines']];const set=sets[Math.floor(Math.random()*sets.length)];const mixed=[...set].sort(()=>Math.random()-.5);window.sentenceAnswer=set;window.sentenceChosen=[];gameShell('🧱 Sentence Builder',`<p>Tap the words in the correct order:</p><div class="row">${mixed.map(x=>`<button type="button" class="sentence-word" data-word="${attr(x)}" onclick="addWord(this.dataset.word,this)">${x}</button>`).join('')}</div><div id="sentenceOut" class="lesson">Your sentence: </div><button type="button" class="green" onclick="checkSentence(window.sentenceAnswer)">Check sentence ⭐</button><div id="nextGame" class="row hidden"><button class="primary" type="button" onclick="sentenceGame()">Next ➜</button></div>`)}

function addWord(w,btn){window.sentenceChosen=window.sentenceChosen||[];if(window.sentenceChosen.includes(w))return;window.sentenceChosen.push(w);if(btn)btn.disabled=true;$('sentenceOut').textContent='Your sentence: '+window.sentenceChosen.join(' ')}

function checkSentence(set){if(JSON.stringify(window.sentenceChosen)===JSON.stringify(set)){winGame('Sentence superstar! 🧱',8);document.querySelectorAll('.sentence-word').forEach(b=>b.disabled=true);$('nextGame')?.classList.remove('hidden')}else pop('Keep trying! 💪','Think about which word should start the sentence.')}

function synonymGame(){const data=[['happy','joyful','sad','quiet'],['big','large','tiny','slow'],['quick','fast','cold','heavy'],['begin','start','finish','sleep'],['smart','clever','wet','late']];const d=data[Math.floor(Math.random()*data.length)];gameShell('🔗 Meaning Match',`<div class="big">${d[0]}</div><p>Which word has a similar meaning?</p>${d.slice(1).sort(()=>Math.random()-.5).map(x=>`<button type="button" class="choice game-choice" data-correct="${x===d[1]}" onclick="chooseGameAnswer(this)">${x}</button>`).join('')}<div id="nextGame" class="row hidden"><button class="primary" type="button" onclick="synonymGame()">Next ➜</button></div>`)}

function translationGame(){const w=WORDS[Math.floor(Math.random()*WORDS.length)];const askAfr=Math.random()>.5;const q=askAfr?w[1]:w[0],answer=askAfr?w[0]:w[1];const opts=[answer,...WORDS.filter(x=>x!==w).sort(()=>Math.random()-.5).slice(0,3).map(x=>askAfr?x[0]:x[1])].sort(()=>Math.random()-.5);gameShell('🌍 Language Switch',`<div class="big">${q}</div><p>Choose the ${askAfr?'English':'Afrikaans'} word:</p>${opts.map(x=>`<button type="button" class="choice game-choice" data-correct="${x===answer}" onclick="chooseGameAnswer(this)">${x}</button>`).join('')}<div id="nextGame" class="row hidden"><button class="primary" type="button" onclick="translationGame()">Next ➜</button></div>`)}

function memoryGame(){const mode=window.memoryMode||'English-Afrikaans';const pairs=WORDS.slice().sort(()=>Math.random()-.5).slice(0,4);const cards=[...pairs.map((w,i)=>({text:mode==='English-Afrikaans'?w[0]:w[1],pair:i})),...pairs.map((w,i)=>({text:mode==='English-Afrikaans'?w[1]:w[0],pair:i}))].sort(()=>Math.random()-.5);window.memoryFirst=null;window.memoryLocked=false;window.memoryFound=0;gameShell('🧠 Memory Pairs',`<div class="row"><button type="button" class="${mode==='English-Afrikaans'?'primary':''}" onclick="window.memoryMode='English-Afrikaans';memoryGame()">🇬🇧 English → 🇿🇦 Afrikaans</button><button type="button" class="${mode==='Afrikaans-English'?'primary':''}" onclick="window.memoryMode='Afrikaans-English';memoryGame()">🇿🇦 Afrikaans → 🇬🇧 English</button></div><p>Tap two cards to find the matching pair.</p><div id="memoryGrid" class="memory-grid">${cards.map((c,i)=>`<button type="button" class="memory-card" data-pair="${c.pair}" data-text="${attr(c.text)}" onclick="flipMemory(this)">❓</button>`).join('')}</div><div id="memoryNext" class="row hidden"><button class="primary" type="button" onclick="memoryGame()">Next ➜</button></div>`)}

function flipMemory(btn){if(window.memoryLocked||btn.classList.contains('found')||btn===window.memoryFirst)return;btn.textContent=btn.dataset.text;btn.classList.add('flipped');if(!window.memoryFirst){window.memoryFirst=btn;return}const first=window.memoryFirst;window.memoryLocked=true;if(first.dataset.pair===btn.dataset.pair){first.classList.add('found');btn.classList.add('found');window.memoryFirst=null;window.memoryLocked=false;window.memoryFound++;winGame('Memory match! 🧠',6);if(window.memoryFound===4){$('memoryNext')?.classList.remove('hidden');pop('Memory board complete! 🎉','Great matching! Tap Next for a new board.')}}else{setTimeout(()=>{first.textContent='❓';btn.textContent='❓';first.classList.remove('flipped');btn.classList.remove('flipped');window.memoryFirst=null;window.memoryLocked=false},700)}}

function speedChallenge(){if(speedTimer)clearInterval(speedTimer);let left=60,score=0,index=0,arr=gradeWords().sort(()=>Math.random()-.5);window.speedCheck=function(){const input=$('fast'),w=arr[index%arr.length];if((input?.value||'').trim().toLowerCase()===w[1].toLowerCase()){score++;index++;if(score>=80){clearInterval(speedTimer);speedTimer=null;S.stars+=80;save();pop('80 words complete! 🏆','Amazing speed and spelling!');return}draw()}else{if(input)input.value='';pop('Keep going! 💪','That answer is not quite right. Try again.')}};function draw(){const w=arr[index%arr.length];$('app').innerHTML=`<section class="card fullscreen-card">${pageTop('⚡ 80 Words / 60 Seconds','Type the Afrikaans word for each English word. The goal is 80.')}<div id="speedTimer" class="timer">${left}s</div><div class="big">${w[0]}</div><input id="fast" class="input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none"><button type="button" class="green" onclick="speedCheck()">Check & Next ⭐</button><h3>Score: ${score} / 80</h3><p>Correct answers move you to the next word. Wrong answers can be tried again.</p></section>`;setTimeout(()=>{$('fast')?.focus()},50)}speedTimer=setInterval(()=>{left--;const t=$('speedTimer');if(t)t.textContent=left+'s';if(left<=0){clearInterval(speedTimer);speedTimer=null;S.stars+=score;save();pop('Challenge complete! ⚡',`You got ${score} correct. Your next goal is 80!`)}},1000);draw()}

function stories(){const list=storyFilter==='All'?STORIES:STORIES.filter(s=>s.lang===storyFilter);return `<section class="card fullscreen-card">${pageTop('📖 Story World','100 original reading books — 50 English + 50 Afrikaans. Choose a book, read it, listen to it and answer questions.')}<div class="row"><button class="${storyFilter==='All'?'primary':''}" onclick="storyFilter='All';render()">📚 All 100</button><button class="${storyFilter==='English'?'primary':''}" onclick="storyFilter='English';render()">🇬🇧 English 50</button><button class="${storyFilter==='Afrikaans'?'primary':''}" onclick="storyFilter='Afrikaans';render()">🇿🇦 Afrikaans 50</button></div><p><b>${list.length}</b> books available. Reading is organised in short, manageable texts with comprehension practice.</p><div class="story-grid">${list.map((s,i)=>{const real=STORIES.indexOf(s);return `<article class="card story-card"><div class="story-label">${s.lang==='English'?'🇬🇧 English':'🇿🇦 Afrikaans'} • Book ${real+1}</div><h2>${s.title}</h2><p>${s.text.slice(0,150)}…</p><div class="row"><button class="primary" onclick="openStory(${real})">📖 Open book</button><button onclick="speakData(this)" data-text="${attr(s.text)}" data-lang="${s.lang}">🔊 Listen</button></div></article>`}).join('')}</div></section>`}
function openStory(i){storyIndex=i;page='storyread';render();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})}
function storyRead(){const s=STORIES[storyIndex]||STORIES[0];return `<section class="card fullscreen-card book-reader"><div class="page-top"><button class="round-back" onclick="go('stories')" aria-label="Back to stories">←</button><div><h2>${s.lang==='English'?'🇬🇧':'🇿🇦'} ${s.title}</h2><p>${s.lang} • Book ${storyIndex+1} of 100</p></div><span id="speakStatus" class="speak-status"></span></div><div class="book-text"><p>${s.text}</p></div><div class="row"><button class="primary" onclick="speakData(this)" data-text="${attr(s.text)}" data-lang="${s.lang}">🔊 Read the whole book</button><button onclick="stopSpeaking()">⏹ Stop</button><button onclick="quiz(${storyIndex},0)">🎯 Questions</button></div><div class="lesson"><b>Reading tip:</b> Read the story once yourself, then listen, then explain the main idea in your own words.</div></section>`}
function quiz(si,qi){const s=STORIES[si],q=s.qs[qi];gameShell(`🎯 ${s.title}`,`<h3>${qi+1} of ${s.qs.length}: ${q[0]}</h3>${q[1].map((a,j)=>`<button class="choice" onclick="answerStory(${si},${qi},${j})">${a}</button>`).join('')}<button onclick="speakData(this)" data-text="${attr(q[0])}" data-lang="${s.lang}">🔊 Read question</button><button onclick="speakOptionsData(this)" data-options="${attr(JSON.stringify(q[1]))}" data-lang="${s.lang}">🔊 Read options</button>`)}
function answerStory(si,qi,j){const q=STORIES[si].qs[qi];if(j===q[2]){if(qi+1<STORIES[si].qs.length)quiz(si,qi+1);else{S.stories++;reward(15,'Story finished! 📖✨')}}else pop('Not quite! 💪','Read that part again and have another go.')}
function maths(){const g=Number($('grade').value||3);return `<section class="card fullscreen-card">${pageTop('➗ Maths Academy','Grade ${g}: arithmetic, fractions, money, measurement, geometry and word problems.')}<div class="grid"><button class="tile" onclick="mathChallenge('arithmetic')"><span>➕</span><b>Number Challenge</b></button><button class="tile" onclick="mathChallenge('tables')"><span>✖️</span><b>Times Tables</b></button><button class="tile" onclick="mathChallenge('fractions')"><span>🍕</span><b>Fractions</b></button><button class="tile" onclick="mathChallenge('money')"><span>💰</span><b>Money</b></button><button class="tile" onclick="mathChallenge('measurement')"><span>📏</span><b>Measurement</b></button><button class="tile" onclick="mathChallenge('geometry')"><span>📐</span><b>Geometry</b></button><button class="tile" onclick="mathChallenge('word')"><span>🧠</span><b>Word Problems</b></button><button class="tile" onclick="mathChallenge('patterns')"><span>🔢</span><b>Patterns</b></button></div></section>`}
function mathChallenge(type){const g=Number($('grade').value||3);let q='',ans=0,ex='';if(type==='tables'){const n=Math.min(12,2+g),b=Math.floor(Math.random()*12)+1;ans=n*b;q=`${n} × ${b} = ?`;ex=`Think of ${n} groups of ${b}.`}else if(type==='arithmetic'){const max=g<=4?20:g<=5?50:g<=6?100:500;let a=Math.floor(Math.random()*max)+1,b=Math.floor(Math.random()*max)+1;const op=['+','−','×'][Math.floor(Math.random()*3)];if(op==='−'&&b>a)[a,b]=[b,a];ans=op==='+'?a+b:op==='−'?a-b:a*b;q=`${a} ${op} ${b} = ?`;ex='Work one step at a time.'}else if(type==='fractions'){const den=[2,4,5,8,10][Math.floor(Math.random()*5)],num=Math.floor(Math.random()*(den-1))+1;ans=num/den;q=`What is ${num}/${den} as a decimal?`;ex='Divide the numerator by the denominator.'}else if(type==='money'){const price=(Math.floor(Math.random()*80)+10)*1.5,paid=Math.ceil(price/10)*10;ans=Number((paid-price).toFixed(2));q=`A toy costs R${price.toFixed(2)}. You pay R${paid.toFixed(2)}. Change?`;ex='Subtract the price from the amount paid.'}else if(type==='measurement'){const a=Math.floor(Math.random()*9)+2,b=Math.floor(Math.random()*9)+2;ans=a*b;q=`A rectangle is ${a} cm long and ${b} cm wide. What is its area in cm²?`;ex='Area = length × width.'}else if(type==='geometry'){const shapes=[['square',4],['triangle',3],['pentagon',5],['hexagon',6],['octagon',8]],s=shapes[Math.floor(Math.random()*shapes.length)];ans=s[1];q=`How many sides does a ${s[0]} have?`;ex='Count the straight sides.'}else if(type==='patterns'){const start=Math.floor(Math.random()*10)+1,step=Math.floor(Math.random()*8)+2;ans=start+step*4;q=`${start}, ${start+step}, ${start+2*step}, ${start+3*step}, ___`;ex='Find the number added each time.'}else{const packs=Math.floor(Math.random()*6)+3,each=Math.floor(Math.random()*8)+2;ans=packs*each;q=`There are ${packs} bags with ${each} apples in each. How many apples?`;ex='Use multiplication.'}gameShell('🧠 Maths Challenge',`<div class="big">${q}</div><p>${ex}</p><input id="ma" class="input" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off"><button type="button" class="green" onclick="checkMath(${JSON.stringify(ans)},'${type}')">Check ⭐</button><button type="button" onclick="mathChallenge('${type}')">New challenge 🔄</button><div id="mathNext" class="row hidden"><button class="primary" type="button" onclick="mathChallenge('${type}')">Next ➜</button></div>`)}
function checkMath(ans,type){const got=Number($('ma')?.value);if(Number.isFinite(got)&&Math.abs(got-Number(ans))<0.001){S.maths++;reward(10,'Maths master! 🧠');$('ma').disabled=true;$('mathNext')?.classList.remove('hidden')}else pop('Good try! 💪','Work it out step by step and try again.')}

function checkTime(id,answer,nextFn,numeric=false){const raw=($(id)?.value||'').trim();const ok=numeric?Number(raw)===Number(answer):raw.toLowerCase()===String(answer).toLowerCase();if(ok){reward(8,'Correct! ⏰');$(id).disabled=true;$('timeNext')?.classList.remove('hidden')}else pop('Keep practising! 💪','Read the question carefully and try again.')}
function checkTimeData(btn,id,nextFn,numeric=false){checkTime(id,btn.dataset.answer,nextFn,numeric)}
function timePage(){return `<section class="card fullscreen-card">${pageTop('🕒 Time Academy','Learn clocks, 24-hour time, duration and daily schedules.')}<div class="grid"><button class="tile" onclick="clockChallenge()"><span>🕰️</span><b>Read the Clock</b></button><button class="tile" onclick="durationChallenge()"><span>⏱️</span><b>Duration</b></button><button class="tile" onclick="scheduleChallenge()"><span>📅</span><b>Daily Schedule</b></button></div><div class="lesson"><b>Remember:</b> 15 minutes = quarter of an hour; 30 minutes = half an hour; 45 minutes = quarter to the next hour.</div></section>`}
function clockChallenge(){const h=Math.floor(Math.random()*12)+1,m=[0,15,30,45][Math.floor(Math.random()*4)],ans=`${h}:${String(m).padStart(2,'0')}`;gameShell('🕰️ Read the Clock',`<div class="big">🕰️ ${ans}</div><p>Type the digital time shown.</p><input id="ti" class="input" placeholder="Example: 3:30"><button type="button" class="green" data-answer="${attr(ans)}" onclick="checkTimeData(this,'ti','clockChallenge')">Check ⭐</button><div id="timeNext" class="row hidden"><button class="primary" type="button" onclick="clockChallenge()">Next challenge ➜</button></div>`)}

function durationChallenge(){const start=8+Math.floor(Math.random()*4),mins=[30,45,60,90,120][Math.floor(Math.random()*5)],end=start*60+mins,ans=Math.floor(end/60);gameShell('⏱️ Duration',`<p>A lesson starts at ${start}:00 and lasts ${mins} minutes. What hour does it end?</p><input id="du" class="input" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Hour only"><button type="button" class="green" data-answer="${attr(ans)}" onclick="checkTimeData(this,'du','durationChallenge',true)">Check</button><div id="timeNext" class="row hidden"><button class="primary" type="button" onclick="durationChallenge()">Next challenge ➜</button></div>`)}

function scheduleChallenge(){const q=[['School starts at 08:00. Recess is 2 hours later. What time is recess?','10:00'],['Dinner starts at 18:30 and ends at 19:15. How long is dinner?','45'],['A movie starts at 15:00 and lasts 90 minutes. When does it end?','16:30']][Math.floor(Math.random()*3)];gameShell('📅 Daily Schedule',`<p>${q[0]}</p><input id="sc" class="input"><button type="button" class="green" data-answer="${attr(q[1])}" onclick="checkTimeData(this,'sc','scheduleChallenge')">Check</button><div id="timeNext" class="row hidden"><button class="primary" type="button" onclick="scheduleChallenge()">Next challenge ➜</button></div>`)}

function practiseWeak(btn){const w=WORDS.find(z=>z[0]===btn.dataset.word);if(w){current=w;spellMode='English';go('spelling')}}
function dictionary(){const k=Object.keys(S.weak);return `<section class="card fullscreen-card">${pageTop('📕 My Personal Dictionary','Words that need extra practice appear here.')}<p>Try tricky words again after a delay. 🔁</p>${k.length?k.map(x=>{const w=WORDS.find(z=>z[0]===x);return `<div class="lesson"><b>${x}</b>${w?` — ${w[1]}`:''}<p>Struggled ${S.weak[x]} time(s)</p><button type="button" onclick="speakData(this)" data-text="${attr(x)}" data-lang="English">🔊 Hear</button><button type="button" onclick="practiseWeak(this)" data-word="${attr(x)}">Practise ⭐</button></div>`}).join(''):'<p>🌟 No difficult words yet. Keep learning!</p>'}</section>`}

function progress(){const pct=S.stars%100;return `<section class="card fullscreen-card">${pageTop('📊 My Progress','See what has been practised and what to do next.')}<h3>⭐ ${S.stars} Stars</h3><p>🏆 Level ${S.level}</p><p>Activities completed: ${S.done}</p><p>✏️ Spelling wins: ${S.spelling} • 🎮 Game wins: ${S.gameWins} • ➗ Maths: ${S.maths} • 📖 Stories: ${S.stories}</p><div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:${pct}%"></div></div><h3>Badges</h3>${S.badges.map(b=>`<span class="badge">${b}</span>`).join('')||'Keep going to unlock badges!'}<div class="lesson"><b>Learning idea:</b> Do a short reading or vocabulary session, then revisit difficult words later. The DBE workbooks use regular practice and progress tracking to support literacy and numeracy. </div><button onclick="if(confirm('Reset all progress?')){localStorage.removeItem('wa_state');location.reload()}">Reset progress</button></section>`}
function render(){stats();if($('backBtn'))$('backBtn').classList.toggle('hidden',page==='home');$('app').innerHTML=page==='home'?home():page==='learn'?learn():page==='spelling'?spelling():page==='games'?games():page==='stories'?stories():page==='storyread'?storyRead():page==='maths'?maths():page==='time'?timePage():page==='dictionary'?dictionary():progress()}
if($('grade')){$('grade').value=localStorage.getItem('wa_grade')||'3';$('grade').onchange=e=>{localStorage.setItem('wa_grade',e.target.value);if(page==='spelling')render()}}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('[data-page]');if(b){e.preventDefault();go(b.dataset.page)}});
render();
if('speechSynthesis' in window)speechSynthesis.onvoiceschanged=()=>{};
if('serviceWorker' in navigator)navigator.serviceWorker.register('./sw.js');
let deferred;$('install').classList.add('hidden');window.addEventListener('beforeinstallprompt',e=>{e.preventDefault();deferred=e;$('install').classList.remove('hidden')});$('install').onclick=async()=>{if(deferred){deferred.prompt();await deferred.userChoice;deferred=null}else alert('On some tablets use the browser menu → Add to Home screen / Install app.')};
